Summary:
For creating an agent with MCP tools using DeepWiki server, the most relevant files are:
- Implementation: camel/agents/mcp_agent.py and camel/toolkits/mcp_toolkit.py
- Examples: examples/agents/mcp_agent/mcp_agent_using_registry.py and examples/agents/mcp_agent/mcp_agent_without_function_calling.py

These examples show how to create and run MCPAgent with registry configs or local config files. The MCPAgent class integrates MCPToolkit which manages MCP server connections and tools.

No existing example specifically for DeepWiki server was found, but the MCPAgent and MCPToolkit support custom MCP server configurations, so you can adapt the example scripts to use the DeepWiki MCP server config.

No existing script in task-script/single_agent for MCPAgent or DeepWiki was found, so you will create a new script there as requested.
